      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. so basically i'm just looking for anything that isn't directly tied to the main key. can you give me a slightly more complex example? maybe something involving order details or product info where it's not just a simple address thing. i want to make sure i don't miss things when i'm actually looking at the tables.",
